{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35849","headline":"寄题从兄坤载村居 · 李咸用","name":"寄题从兄坤载村居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邻并无非樵钓者，庄生物论宛然齐。\n雨中寒树愁鸱立，江上残阳瘦马嘶。\n说与衆佣同版筑，吕将羣叟共磻溪。\n覆巢破卵方堪惧，取次梧桐凤且栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}